# {{lb|en|transitive}} To break seawater with the poop (stern) of a vessel, especially the [[poop deck]].
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To break over the stern of (a vessel).
#: {{ux|en|We were '''pooped''' within hailing of the quay and were nearly sunk.}}
